### Featured

- The BOSS Scorecard: pin the link to the scorecard as the first featured item. Label it 'Find out what's capping your profit right now, takes three minutes.' This is the primary lead magnet and should be the first thing a visiting MD sees.
- A LinkedIn post or article on margin bleed: pin the highest-performing piece of content that speaks directly to the 'won the work, lost the money' problem. If none exists yet, write a post on the three places margin disappears on a building services contract before the MD even knows there's a problem, then pin it.
